<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %> | CSE 340</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <p class="eyebrow">CSE 340</p>
      <h1>Web Backend Development</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Your Express app is running with EJS, environment variables, and a
        route-controller-view flow.
      </p>

      <section class="flow" aria-label="Request response flow">
        <article class="card">
          <h2>1. Route</h2>
          <p><code>routes/baseRoute.js</code> listens for <code>GET /</code>.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h2>2. Controller</h2>
          <p>
            <code>controllers/baseController.js</code> decides which view to
            render and what data to send.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h2>3. View</h2>
          <p>
            <code>views/index.ejs</code> turns that data into HTML for the
            browser.
          </p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>

    <% if (enableLiveReload) { %>
      <script src="/js/live-reload.js"></script>
    <% } %>
  </body>
</html>
